Lojban is now available as a language for graphical interface on tatoeba.org
website.

Although, it's available on the production branch I suggest that you test
it using the dev branch which has the latest translations:
http://dev.tatoeba.org/jbo/

Feel free to report me of any mistakes and of any strings the translation
of which you don't like. Think of possible solutions, though!

I'll report later of (what in my opinion will be) a worthwhile (ready to
use) translation on the production branch.

